DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ddwwiiiicc driver supports the Synopsys DesignWare I2C controller for use
     with the iic(4) framework.

     On systems using the Intel OnChip System Fabric, ddwwiiiicc may need the
     iosf(4) driver to coordinate access to the I2C bus.

